{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 fits my Fire TV setup while adding a screen for video calling, giving me a useful new function.",
    "The memory card feels like a practical next purchase after my Canon camcorder, provided the camcorder supports it. Camera recommendations also reflect my interest in home monitoring."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Echo Auto and AirPods Pro address driving and personal listening needs that I have not expressed through my recent home viewing and camera purchases.",
    "Another Fire TV Stick or camera may fit my interests, but I already have equipment serving those purposes. The tablet also offers another viewing screen without a current need for portable viewing."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any Alexa or Amazon device, even when its purpose does not fit what I currently need.",
    "My interest in cameras and screens seems to have been treated as a reason to buy more of them, without enough attention to what another device would add."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases create different next steps: the camcorder may need compatible storage, while the newly added Blink camera reduces my immediate need for another monitoring camera.",
    "I choose selectively when something adds a clear function. I would pick the Echo Show 8 over the smaller Show or a separate speaker, and I need a specific appliance in mind before choosing a smart plug."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in home entertainment and cameras, but overlook whether each item adds a useful function to equipment I already have."
}"}
